{"version": 2, "width": 105, "height": 27, "title": "GTM Workbench / actual CLI outputs / synthetic fixture"}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HGTM WORKBENCH | Aditya Chouhan\r\nSynthetic data; simulated reviewer; actual CLI state\r\n\r\n01 / Evidence comes first\r\n\r\n$ gtm-workbench status\r\n\r\nqualify-accounts        ready     \r\ndraft-email             blocked   \r\nreview-campaign         blocked   \r\n\r\nThe root task is ready. Dependent drafts wait for reviewed research.\r\n\r\nRecorded locally. No model calls, messages or paid actions.\r\n"]
[12, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HGTM WORKBENCH | Aditya Chouhan\r\nSynthetic data; simulated reviewer; actual CLI state\r\n\r\n02 / Review an exact artifact\r\n\r\n$ gtm-workbench submit qualify-accounts ...\r\n\r\nqualify-accounts        review    \r\ndraft-email             blocked   \r\nreview-campaign         blocked   \r\n\r\nThe submitted file is snapshotted. Approval requires its SHA-256.\r\n\r\nRecorded locally. No model calls, messages or paid actions.\r\n"]
[24, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HGTM WORKBENCH | Aditya Chouhan\r\nSynthetic data; simulated reviewer; actual CLI state\r\n\r\n03 / Approval unlocks downstream work\r\n\r\n$ gtm-workbench review qualify-accounts approve --sha ...\r\n\r\nqualify-accounts        approved  \r\ndraft-email             ready     \r\nreview-campaign         blocked   \r\n\r\nApproved research unlocks drafting. The final review still waits.\r\n\r\nRecorded locally. No model calls, messages or paid actions.\r\n"]
[36, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HGTM WORKBENCH | Aditya Chouhan\r\nSynthetic data; simulated reviewer; actual CLI state\r\n\r\n04 / A complete, inspectable chain\r\n\r\n$ gtm-workbench status\r\n\r\nqualify-accounts        approved  \r\ndraft-email             approved  \r\nreview-campaign         approved  \r\n\r\nAll three fixture outputs are reviewed. No message was sent.\r\n\r\nRecorded locally. No model calls, messages or paid actions.\r\n"]
[48, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HGTM WORKBENCH | Aditya Chouhan\r\nSynthetic data; simulated reviewer; actual CLI state\r\n\r\n05 / Changed evidence invalidates old work\r\n\r\n$ edit company.md \u2192 gtm-workbench status\r\n\r\nqualify-accounts        stale     \r\ndraft-email             stale     \r\nreview-campaign         stale     \r\n\r\nResearch, draft and final review all become stale automatically.\r\n\r\nRecorded locally. No model calls, messages or paid actions.\r\n"]
[60, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HGTM WORKBENCH | Aditya Chouhan\r\nSynthetic data; simulated reviewer; actual CLI state\r\n\r\n06 / Stale approval is rejected\r\n\r\n$ gtm-workbench review review-campaign approve --sha OLD_HASH\r\n\r\nqualify-accounts        stale     \r\ndraft-email             stale     \r\nreview-campaign         stale     \r\n\r\nerror: Only current review artifacts can be approved; task is stale\r\n\r\nRecorded locally. No model calls, messages or paid actions.\r\n"]
[72, "o", "\r\nEnd of walkthrough.\r\n"]
